title: Trading Places
text: Four rooms and two cannons. Each muzzle wants a colour its own laser does not have.
trick: blue reaches the red muzzle by running backwards up red's own beam: one splitter in the south-west room, where the two beams cross at right angles, sends each colour back along the other's path into the other's barrel, and its straight-through blue turns down to the blue target
motif: rooms (a floor plan: four rooms, four doors, two cannons in opposite corners)
expect: merges>=1, reversals>=1
